+/* Validates a user password.
+ *
+ * VD Dropbear: passwords are verified against a hash file given by the
+ * DROPBEAR_PASSWD_FILE environment variable, not the system shadow - Android's
+ * bionic has no usable crypt()/shadow. Each line of the file is
+ *     <user>:pbkdf2-sha256$<iterations>$<salt_hex>$<hash_hex>
+ * and the presented password is checked with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256, a public,
+ * standard KDF. There is no obfuscation: format and algorithm are documented,
+ * and only the hash is stored - never the password. */
 
